// `Param name = n` declares a `Var` fact over `Int` whose initial instance is `n`; any integer position may name it, and an act may create a new instance, which the program judges like any event (D11).
Param notice-window = 10
Fact actor Identified by Alice
Fact deadline Identified by Int Derived from deadline(notice-window + 1)
Act amend Actor actor Creates notice-window(20) Holds when True.
?notice-window(10).
?deadline(11).
amend(Alice).
?notice-window(20).
?!notice-window(10).
?deadline(21).
